{%- comment -%}
  Member app · Rewards (Round 8; Round 10 redesign): balance + Rs value, the redeem request with a confirm step,
  how earning works (an earnings calculator + Earn → Climb → Redeem), the tier journey (snh-app-tierjourney), points
  FAQ (faq blocks, else the defaults below). Every number comes from Theme settings → SNH Elite.
  Redeem = the old theme's request, unchanged: customer form → /contact, contact[email], contact[tags]=Trigger_Redeem_2500.
  The store's Flow on that tag issues the reward; the theme never changes a balance. While the tag is on the customer
  the button shows "pending" (a second request would add the same tag, which Flow wouldn't see as new).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign redeem_from = settings.snh_redeem_from | default: 2500
  assign per_point = settings.snh_point_value | default: 1
  assign redeem_rs = redeem_from | times: per_point
  assign welcome = settings.snh_welcome_points | default: 500
  assign r_b = settings.snh_rate_bronze | default: 3
  assign r_s = settings.snh_rate_silver | default: 7
  assign r_g = settings.snh_rate_gold | default: 10
  if m[3] != 'x'
    assign have = m[3] | plus: 0
    assign pct = have | times: 100 | divided_by: redeem_from | at_most: 100
  endif
  assign faqs = 0
  for b in blocks
    if b.type == 'faq'
      assign faqs = faqs | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}
<header class="app__head">
  <p class="eyebrow">Rewards</p>
  <h1 class="app__h" id="{{ sid }}-rewards-h">Your <em>rewards</em></h1>
</header>

<div class="app__ecard">{%- render 'snh-elite-card', m: m, name: me[1], no: me[4], size: 'full' -%}</div>

<div class="bal" data-tier="{{ m[0] }}">
  <div class="bal__fig">
    <p class="bal__l">Points balance</p>
    {%- if m[3] == 'x' -%}
      <p class="bal__n">—</p>
      <p class="bal__v">Shows once your first paid order syncs</p>
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="bal__n">{% render 'snh-num', n: m[3] %}</p>
      <p class="bal__v">Worth {{ m[4] | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} · 1 point = {{ per_point | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="bal__act" data-redeem>
    {%- if m[3] == 'x' -%}
      <p class="bal__p">New members start with {% render 'snh-num', n: welcome %} welcome points. Rewards unlock at {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} points.</p>
      <a class="v-btn v-btn--ink" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"><span>Shop to earn</span></a>
    {%- elsif pending -%}
      <p class="bal__st"><span class="pill pill--wait">Request pending</span></p>
      <p class="bal__p">We've got your request to trade {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} points. Your {{ redeem_rs | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} reward arrives by email, usually within a working day.</p>
    {%- elsif m[14] == '1' -%}
      {%- capture ask -%}
        <div data-redeem-ask>
          <p class="bal__p">Your reward is ready: trade {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} points for {{ redeem_rs | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} off.</p>
          <button class="v-btn v-btn--accent" type="button" data-redeem-go><span>Trade {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} points</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="bal__confirm" data-redeem-confirm hidden role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ sid }}-rc-h">
          <p class="bal__q" id="{{ sid }}-rc-h" tabindex="-1">Trade {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} points for {{ redeem_rs | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} off?</p>
          <p class="bal__p">We'll email the reward to {{ me[2] | escape }}. Your balance drops by {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} once it's issued.</p>
          <div class="bal__btns"><button class="v-btn v-btn--accent" type="{% if mock %}button{% else %}submit{% endif %}"{% if mock %} disabled{% endif %}><span>Yes, trade them</span></button><button class="v-btn v-btn--line" type="button" data-redeem-cancel><span>Not now</span></button></div>
        </div>
      {%- endcapture -%}
        {%- comment -%} Round 10: a real Liquid form, submitted as a normal page POST so Shopify's hCaptcha runs
          (data-shopify-captcha binds it on page load). Back to #rewards with a banner (assets/snh-app.js, flash).
          The mock renders the same markup for QA with its submit button disabled, so it can never post. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- form 'customer', class: 'bal__form', id: 'snh-redeem-form', data-shopify-captcha: 'true', data-snh-post: 'redeem', return_to: '/account?snh_posted=redeem#rewards' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[email]" value="{{ me[2] | escape }}">
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="Trigger_Redeem_2500">
          {{ ask }}
        {%- endform -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="bal__p"><b>{% render 'snh-num', n: m[15] %} points</b> to your first reward. At {{ m[7] }}% back that's about {{ m[15] | times: 100 | divided_by: m[7] | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} of shopping.</p>
      <div class="bal__bar" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="{{ redeem_from }}" aria-valuenow="{{ have }}" aria-label="Points towards your first reward"><i style="width: {{ pct }}%"></i></div>
      <a class="v-btn v-btn--ink" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"><span>Shop to earn</span></a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{%- liquid
  # earnings calculator: starts at the member's average month (spend this year ÷ 12), rounded to the slider step
  assign c_step = 2500
  assign c_val = m[5] | plus: 0 | divided_by: 12 | divided_by: c_step | times: c_step | at_least: 10000 | at_most: 100000
  assign c_pts = c_val | times: m[7] | divided_by: 100
  assign c_have = 0
  if m[3] != 'x'
    assign c_have = m[3] | plus: 0
  endif
  assign c_need = redeem_from | minus: c_have | at_least: 0
  assign c_months = 0
  if c_pts > 0
    assign c_months = c_need | plus: c_pts | minus: 1 | divided_by: c_pts
  endif
  assign silver = settings.snh_silver_threshold | default: 198000
  assign gold = settings.snh_gold_threshold | default: 300000
-%}
<section class="app__block" aria-labelledby="{{ sid }}-earn-h">
  <div class="app__bt">
    <h2 class="app__h2" id="{{ sid }}-earn-h">How earning <em>works</em></h2>
    <p class="app__muted">Move the slider to see what your shopping earns at your {{ m[1] }} rate.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="calc" data-calc data-rate="{{ m[7] }}" data-per="{{ per_point }}" data-from="{{ redeem_from }}" data-have="{{ c_have }}" data-silver="{{ silver }}" data-gold="{{ gold }}">
    <label class="calc__q" for="{{ sid }}-calc">If you spend <output data-calc-spend for="{{ sid }}-calc">{{ c_val | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</output> a month</label>
    <input class="calc__in" id="{{ sid }}-calc" type="range" min="5000" max="100000" step="{{ c_step }}" value="{{ c_val }}" data-calc-in style="--p: {{ c_val | minus: 5000 | times: 100 | divided_by: 95000 }}%">
    <div class="calc__ends" aria-hidden="true"><span>Rs 5,000</span><span>Rs 100,000</span></div>
    <dl class="calc__out">
      <div><dt>Points a month</dt><dd data-calc-pts>{% render 'snh-num', n: c_pts %}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Worth</dt><dd data-calc-val>{{ c_pts | times: per_point | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{% if c_have > 0 %}Next reward{% else %}First reward{% endif %}</dt><dd data-calc-when>{% if c_need == 0 %}Ready now{% elsif c_months == 1 %}In about 1 month{% else %}In about {{ c_months }} months{% endif %}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="calc__tier" data-calc-tier aria-live="polite"></p>
    <p class="app__note">At {{ m[7] }}% back. {% if c_have > 0 %}Counts from your {% render 'snh-num', n: c_have %} points. {% endif %}Real points are credited when each paid order syncs.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="how" role="list">
    <li><span class="how__ic" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'snh-v2-icon', name: 'bag' %}</span><div><h3>Earn</h3><p>Paid orders earn {{ m[7] }}% of their subtotal in points. 1 point = {{ per_point | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }}.</p></div></li>
    <li><span class="how__ic" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'snh-v2-icon', name: 'badge' %}</span><div><h3>Climb</h3><p>Spend {{ silver | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} in a year for Silver ({{ r_s }}%), {{ gold | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} for Gold ({{ r_g }}%).</p></div></li>
    <li><span class="how__ic" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'snh-v2-icon', name: 'gift' %}</span><div><h3>Redeem</h3><p>Trade {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} points for {{ redeem_rs | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} off, right here. It arrives by email.</p></div></li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="app__block" aria-labelledby="{{ sid }}-tiers-h">
  <div class="app__bt">
    <h2 class="app__h2" id="{{ sid }}-tiers-h">Your tier <em>journey</em></h2>
    <p class="app__muted">The higher your tier, the faster your points stack.</p>
  </div>
  {%- render 'snh-app-tierjourney', m: m, sid: sid -%}
</section>

<section class="app__block" aria-labelledby="{{ sid }}-faq-h">
  <h2 class="app__h2" id="{{ sid }}-faq-h">Points, answered</h2>
  <div class="app__faq">
    {%- if faqs > 0 -%}
      {%- for b in blocks -%}{%- if b.type == 'faq' -%}<details class="qa" {{ b.shopify_attributes }}><summary>{{ b.settings.q | escape }}</summary><div class="qa__a">{{ b.settings.a }}</div></details>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <details class="qa"><summary>What happens to my points if I return something?</summary><div class="qa__a"><p>Refunds reverse the points that order earned, so your balance always matches what you kept.</p></div></details>
      <details class="qa"><summary>Why hasn't my tier or balance updated yet?</summary><div class="qa__a"><p>Points and tiers update after a paid order syncs with our loyalty system, usually within a day. Orders that are still pending don't count yet.</p></div></details>
      <details class="qa"><summary>I bought something but didn't get points</summary><div class="qa__a"><p>Use the same email at checkout as on your account, online and in store, so the order connects to you. If it still doesn't show after a couple of days, message us on WhatsApp.</p></div></details>
      <details class="qa"><summary>How much is a point worth?</summary><div class="qa__a"><p>One point is worth {{ per_point | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }}. Trade {% render 'snh-num', n: redeem_from %} points for {{ redeem_rs | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros }} off.</p></div></details>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
